  "contentHtml": "\n<p><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120229060210im_/http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v226/jckskelington/sopor_aeternus_-_feed_me.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">Энэхүү рок дуучины мэдээлэл тэгээд \nгадаад төрх мөн клип нь миний анхаарлыг маш их татлаа. Яагаад гэхээр \nэмэгтэй болохыг хүсдэг нэгэн гэнэ. Гэхдээ хамгийн сонин нь Ойд Хонгил \nдотор амьдардаг гэнэ. Ганцаарханаа. Тэгээд клип нь үнэн аймшигтай хэхэ. \nГэхдээ манай рокууд мөн сонин хачин зүйлд дуртай хүмүүст таалагдах байх \nби итгэж байна. <br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br><!--break--></p><p><div data-archive-video=\"true\"><div data-archive-video=\"true\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/v/9m7ktQIbGh8\" title=\"Архивын видео\" loading=\"lazy\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe></div></div></p><p><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120229060210im_/http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v226/jckskelington/reach.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p><p><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120229060210im_/http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v226/jckskelington/sopor_aeternus_-_feed_me.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120229060210im_/http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v226/jckskelington/contentimage8.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p><p><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120229060210im_/http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v226/jckskelington/sopor_2002_15.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p><p><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120229060210im_/http://i85.photobucket.com/albums/k60/blatidox/SoporAeternus22.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p><p><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120229060210im_/http://1.bp.blogspot.com/_cjLVaIoriuQ/Re8IUbqiUjI/AAAAAAAAADo/qh8sA321AJg/s320/sopor+5.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p><p><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120229060210im_/http://i169.photobucket.com/albums/u205/Toyboxtheatre/l_4d8fc73d454e71ace44a255a2a9ed321.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p><p><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120229060210im_/http://1.bp.blogspot.com/_fn3ju830LgY/SJsBDLGbT9I/AAAAAAAAADY/X29TptGf0ok/s320/Dead_Lovers_Sarabande.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p><p><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120229060210im_/http://www.inrayfitness.com/bbs/UploadFile/2005-3/200532517368541.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p><p><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120229060210im_/http://photos.lacoccinelle.net/29/22/172922.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120229060210im_/http://i85.photobucket.com/albums/k60/blatidox/SoporAeternus22.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p><p><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120229060210im_/http://www.metalwave.it/public/foto_int_band_46.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p><p><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120229060210im_/http://www.soporaeternus.it/index.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p><p><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120229060210im_/http://2.bp.blogspot.com/_cjLVaIoriuQ/Rex8eREmTbI/AAAAAAAAACg/FQLBb0Bytm8/s320/sopor+2.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p><p><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120229060210im_/http://www.eclipse.bestweb.ru/bands/18/pic2_18.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p><p><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120229060210im_/http://heavyscream.ru/wp-content/uploads/2007/04/sopor.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p><p><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120229060210im_/http://img11.nnm.ru/imagez/gallery/5/5/a/5/b/55a5b0671aae4e68f034f3063f1fa511_full.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p><p><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120229060210im_/http://img12.nnm.ru/imagez/gallery/4/b/8/5/7/4b857ed31ed9e34f2287b8db0b030530_full.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120229060210im_/http://photos.lacoccinelle.net/69/28/336928.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p><p><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120229060210im_/http://www.gothic.hu/images/egyuttesek/soporaeternus1.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p>",
  "contentText": "Энэхүү рок дуучины мэдээлэл тэгээд гадаад төрх мөн клип нь миний анхаарлыг маш их татлаа. Яагаад гэхээр эмэгтэй болохыг хүсдэг нэгэн гэнэ. Гэхдээ хамгийн сонин нь Ойд Хонгил дотор амьдардаг гэнэ. Ганцаарханаа. Тэгээд клип нь үнэн аймшигтай хэхэ. Гэхдээ манай рокууд мөн сонин хачин зүйлд дуртай хүмүүст таалагдах байх би итгэж байна.",
